        "summary": "创建VDC(已废弃)",
        "x-resource": "租户管理",
        "description": "创建VDC 接口,支持创建1~5级VDC(响应体中create_at,domain_description,is_domain,regions,enabled,extra暂不支持)。\n接口已废弃,建议使用POST /rest/vdc/v3.1/vdcs替代。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -v -H \"Content-Type:application/json\" -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X POST -d \"{json}\" \"https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.0/vdcs\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|60次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|10次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|1500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|3000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > VDC特性”章节。",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "CreateVDC",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "接口支持的用户token。运营管理员,机机账号权限,VDC管理员权限用户的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "vdcRequest",
            "in": "body",
            "description": "创建VDC请求体结构。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/VDCRequest"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "创建VDC成功。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "vdc": {
                  "domain_id": "3eab45118743438db56895230d1b9941",
                  "upper_vdc_id": "0",
                  "level": 1,
                  "createTime": 0,
                  "default_project": "0",
                  "name": "vdc_test",
